      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 69,
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming and empathetic clinical care team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners overwhelmingly praise the veterinary team, technicians, and front desk receptionists for their warmth, attentiveness, and bedside manner in Pinecrest. Clients appreciate unhurried appointments where practitioners thoroughly answer questions. While one reviewer reported friction with an office manager over billing transparency, most praise the staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 38,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and patient pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how thoughtfully doctors and assistants interact with companion animals, treating dogs, cats, and exotic pets with patience and affection. Clients frequently note that nervous animals remain calm during checkups, vaccinations, and nail trims. The team receives consistent praise for treating patients like beloved family members."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 31,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable medical care and successful treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report reliable medical outcomes across routine preventative visits, urgent consultations, dental procedures, and soft-tissue surgeries. Reviewers credit the hospital with accurate diagnoses and effective medication plans that promptly restore their pets' health. Overall feedback reflects high confidence in clinical expertise and diagnostic testing."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Royal Vet treat exotic pets in addition to dogs and cats?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the hospital provides veterinary care and wellness examinations for dogs, cats, and exotic companion animals in Pinecrest."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are urgent care visits accommodated on weekends?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the practice is open seven days a week and provides same-day appointments and urgent care on Saturdays and Sundays."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the clinic perform surgical procedures and digital diagnostics?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the hospital is equipped for routine and urgent surgeries, dental cleanings, digital radiography, and in-house laboratory testing."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
  ],
